<title>NORWAY: Fokus 9-mo results fall.</title>
<headline>Fokus 9-mo results fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net interest income			     689	 vs	730</p>
<p> Total other operating income		  330	 vs	333</p>
<p> Total operating expenses			620	 vs	649</p>
<p> Operating result before losses		399	 vs	414</p>
<p> Losses on loans and guarantees		 17	 vs	 12</p>
<p> Pre-tax result from ordinary operations   393	 vs	416</p>
<p> After-tax result from ordinary operations 383	 vs	416</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norway's third largest commercial bank is</p>
<p>Fokus Bank ASA. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a</p>
<p>pre-tax result of 385 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
